"工作階段未啟用表示 StarFly 的背景工作已結束。其他 App 也可能需要一些時間才能取得新的實際位置。" = "An inactive session means StarFly’s background task has ended. Other apps may need a little time to receive the real location.";
"這會檢查已儲存的配對紀錄，以及已配對的 iPhone 是否能透過 LocalDevVPN 找到。它不會開始、變更或停止你的位置。" = "This checks the saved pairing record and whether LocalDevVPN can find the paired iPhone. It won’t start, change, or stop your location.";
"複製僅包含狀態的報告，可貼到錯誤回報中。絕不包含位置、搜尋、配對紀錄、PIN 碼、裝置名稱或錯誤文字。" = "The copied report contains status only. It excludes location, searches, pairing records, PINs, device names, and error text.";
"其他 VPN 可能影響本機裝置連線。如果你的網路環境允許，請暫停該 VPN 後進行比較測試。開始位置工作階段時請保持 LocalDevVPN 啟用。" = "Other VPNs can affect local device connections. If your network allows, pause them for comparison. Keep LocalDevVPN enabled during a location session.";
"StarFly 未偵測到其他 VPN。這只是疑難排解檢查，不代表診斷結果；iOS 的排程器拒絕可能在配對連線開始前發生。" = "StarFly didn’t detect another VPN. This is a troubleshooting check, not a diagnosis; iOS may reject a connection before pairing begins.";
"啟用分享後，StarFly 只會傳送少量且固定的匿名活動計數。" = "When enabled, StarFly sends only a small, fixed set of anonymous activity counts.";
"此安裝會建立一組隨機識別碼，傳送前會以不可逆方式進行雜湊。它僅用於估算參與安裝的活動量。" = "This installation creates a random identifier and irreversibly hashes it before sending. It’s used only to estimate aggregate activity.";
"關閉分享後會停止新的資料回報、在可能的情況下取消進行中的請求，並從 StarFly 移除識別碼。但無法撤回已收到的匿名事件。" = "Turning sharing off stops future reports, cancels in-flight requests when possible, and removes the identifier from StarFly. Already received anonymous events can’t be recalled.";
"StarFly 使用精簡的第一方傳送機制，而非分析 SDK，因此不會自動加入額外的裝置中繼資料。" = "StarFly uses a lightweight first-party delivery mechanism instead of an analytics SDK, so it doesn’t automatically add extra device metadata.";
